Transformations: names normalized to kebab-case, with the original names in
the registry; source missing markers (? and, for bank-marketing, unknown)
rendered as the dedicated missing sentinel; text-valued attributes declared
categorical with levels in metadata; integral values written with a decimal
point stored as integers; adult and optdigits train and test files stacked
with a split column, wine-quality red and white files with a colour column,
student-performance mathematics and Portuguese files with a subject column;
adult test labels lose their trailing period; mushroom bruises? renamed
bruises; spambase character columns named after the character; concrete and
energy-efficiency columns named from their documentation. Source row order
and numeric precision retained. Source versions, archive and normalized
SHA-256 hashes, variable descriptions, citations, and dataset-specific notes
are in the registry (datasets/uci-data/registry.rktd). Upstream documentation
is retained in datasets/uci-data/provenance; the CC BY 4.0 text is in
datasets/uci-data/licenses.
